## Command Reference Table

| Command | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `pacman -Syu` | Sync and update all packages |
| `pacman -Qe` | List explicitly installed packages |
| `pacman -Qdt` | Identify unused dependencies (orphans) |
| `sudo pacman -Sc` | Clean the package cache |
| `pacman -Qk` | Validate package integrity/file presence |
| `pacman -Qm` | List packages from outside official repos (AUR) |
| `pacman -Ql <pkg>` | List all files belonging to a package |
| `checkupdates` | Safely check for updates without syncing |
| `pacman -Syy` | Force refresh of all package databases |

